"/us/en/peripheral-vascular/clinical/clout": {"template":"long-page-detail","metadata":{"title":"CLOUT","pageTitle":null,"description":null,"image":null,"imageAlt":null,"tags":["stryker:content-type/hcp_content"],"originallyPublished":"2026-10-08T20:06:55.000Z","lastPublished":"2026-10-08T20:11:20.000Z","contentID":"PRO-4511-USA-EN-v1"},"anchors":[{"id":"design","title":"Design","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"outcomes","title":"Outcomes","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"evidence","title":"clinical evidence","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"}],"disclaimer":"<p>* ≥75% thrombus removal assessed via Marder score by an independent core laboratory</p>\r\n<p><b>References</b></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Dexter D, et al. Safety and effectiveness of mechanical thrombectomy from the fully enrolled multicenter, prospective CLOUT registry. J Soc Cardiov Angiog Interv. 2023;2(2):100585.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Shaikh A, et al. Six-month outcomes of mechanical thrombectomy for treating deep vein thrombosis: analysis from the 500-patient CLOUT registry. Cardiovasc Intervent Radiol. 2023; 46(11):1571-1580.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Dexter, Dr. Complete Two-Year Outcomes in Patients Receiving Mechanical Thrombectomy for Deep Vein Thrombosis in the CLOUT Registry. Presetened at VIVA/VEINS 2024.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div><b>Indications for Use</b><br>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>The ClotTriever® thrombectomy system is indicated for (1) the non-surgical removal of thrombi and emboli from blood vessels and (2) injection, infusion and/or aspiration of contrast media and other fluids into or from a blood vessel. The ClotTriever thrombectomy system is intended for use in the peripheral, vasculature, including deep vein thrombosis (DVT).</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>Review complete Instructions for Use, Indications for Use, Warnings, Precautions, Possible Adverse Effects and Contraindications prior to use of the product.</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><b>Caution</b></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>Federal (USA) law restricts this device to sale by or on the order of a physician.</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>All trademarks are property of their respective owners.</div>","forms":[],"tabs":[],"cardLists":[],"missingAlt":[]},
